          <div class="event-line-card">
            <img class="event-poster-portrait mb-3" src="/images/no-to-nato.jpg" alt="Istanbul Anti-imperalist Peace Summit" loading="lazy">
            <p class="kicker mb-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-days"></i> 2026-07-04 - 19:00</p>
            <h2 class="h5 mb-1">Istanbul Anti-imperalist Peace Summit</h2>
            <p class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i> Istanbul / Kadikoy</p>
            <p class="mb-3 text-muted">In anticipation of the NATO summit to be held in Ankara in July 2026, we are organizing an Anti-Imperialist Peace Summit with the participation of peace activists, leftists, and socialists from around the world.

Contact us for detailed information about the summit and to apply to participate.</p>

            <div class="timeline-mini-countdown" data-event-at="2026-07-04 19:00">
              <span><strong data-unit="d">0</strong>d</span>
              <span><strong data-unit="h">00</strong>h</span>
              <span><strong data-unit="m">00</strong>m</span>
              <span><strong data-unit="s">00</strong>s</span>
            </div>

            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3">
              <a href="/en/event/istanbul-uluslararasi-anti-emperyalist-baris-zirvesi-2026-07-04-14" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Details</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
                              <article class="event-line-item">
          <div class="event-line-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="event-line-card">
            <img class="event-poster-portrait mb-3" src="/uploads/events/4-nisan-en.jpeg" alt="Global Anti-Militarist Webinar – April 4, 2026 Registration Form" loading="lazy">
            <p class="kicker mb-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-days"></i> 2026-04-04 - 19:00</p>
            <h2 class="h5 mb-1">Global Anti-Militarist Webinar – April 4, 2026 Registration Form</h2>
            <p class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i> Online / Global Webinar</p>
            <p class="mb-3 text-muted">As Turkish socialists, we call on progressive people around the world to oppose NATO&#039;s war budget. Let&#039;s meet in Turkey in 2026 at the People&#039;s Summit against the NATO Summit to end military pacts, the use of military force, and the support of states like Israel that violate international law through military force.

The Global Anti-Militarist Webinar aims to bring together activists, academics, trade unions, representatives of political parties and organizations, and social movements for coordinated discussion and joint action against militarization and war policies.

Join the People&#039;s Summit against the war organization NATO Summit. NO TO NATO!

Please complete this form to register and express your interest in participating. The information you provide will be used solely for event coordination and communication regarding this initiative.

For inquiries: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="422c2d362d2c23362d737b767b02252f232b2e6c212d2f">[email&#160;protected]</a></p>

            <div class="timeline-mini-countdown" data-event-at="2026-04-04 19:00">
              <span><strong data-unit="d">0</strong>d</span>
              <span><strong data-unit="h">00</strong>h</span>
              <span><strong data-unit="m">00</strong>m</span>
              <span><strong data-unit="s">00</strong>s</span>
            </div>

            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3">
              <a href="/en/event/kuresel-anti-militarist-webinar-4-nisan-2026-kayit-formu-2026-04-04-13" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Details</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
          </div>
